.git
**/target
**/__pycache__
# demo/generated holds the SP's private key and certificate, the SP and IdP
# metadata, and any other file the install script wrote. Only idpCa's file, the
# iya-sts listener CA trust chain, goes into the demo image (Dockerfile,
# COPY demo demo).
demo/generated/*
!demo/generated/idp-ca.pem
